# Routing and Layout Rules

- Follow route-group conventions in `src/routes`.
- `(auth)` group uses centered card layout for operator login.
- `(protected)` group uses sidebar shell — see `15-admin-console.mdc`.
- Use route-level orchestration; avoid deeply embedding route concerns into generic components.
- Use `A` links for navigation unless non-router behavior is needed.
- `returnTo` query param allowed only for post-login redirect.
